// [acc] SpawnActor derived-entry aitype (user 2026-07-04): the pack GDT ships
// variant_zm_avogadro -> spawner_zm_avogadro (a .map classname actor_spawner_zm_avogadro
// resolves to aitype spawner_zm_avogadro). We spawn him at RUNTIME via
// SpawnActor("spawner_zm_avogadro", ...) - the Rogue Protector recipe - because a .map
// actor_spawner_zm_avogadro entity CRASHES the LED bake (map_source note ~L3969). This aitype
// line is REQUIRED and must be listed EXPLICITLY (no BSP entity pulls the derived spawner in).
aitype,spawner_zm_avogadro
