fx,zombie/fxt/fx_tesla_bolt_secondary_zmb
// [acc] De-rez teleport burst (docs/44 workstream A; audio pass 2 + BANK CACHE NUKE 2026-07-17;
// audio pass 3 same night: +acc_scientist_numbers_lp synth loop (row FileSpec re-baked after a shell formfeed mangle);
// audio pass 4: hum wav swapped to the AUTHENTIC BO1 numbers broadcast (num_04 via prep_scientist_numbers_from_rip.js, install-side only) - this comment edit is the bank-regen trigger -
// audio pass 5 (2026-07-21 SFX enhancement sweep): +11 aliases in acc_audio.csv (acc_cj_zap/thunder/charge_25/50/75/jackin, acc_glitch_altar_spin, acc_reactor_online, acc_avo_crackle_lp, acc_avo_death, acc_shard_deny) + freezegun dryfire repoint - THIS comment bump forces the bank regen (game CLOSED) -
// audio pass 6 (2026-07-22 gun/feedback + intro swap): headshot-kill ding wav swapped; Triple Take fire repointed off the beam/HAVOC wav to acc\fx\tripletake_fire.wav (pitch 0, secondary cleared); Alternator fire to acc\fx\alternator_fire.wav; intro main_theme.wav replaced (The One, 18.76s, faded); +acc_shield_break implant SFX - THIS comment bump forces the bank regen (game CLOSED) -
// audio pass 7 (2026-07-22): CYBERJACK shoot SFX swapped to Devotion - the CYBERJACK-exclusive wpn_apex_lstar_fire (the weapon's loopFireSound; apex_lstar is quest-only, never in box) repointed to acc\fx\cj_fire.wav - THIS comment bump forces the bank regen (game CLOSED) -
// audio pass 8 (2026-07-22): shield-break SFX now 3d so teammates hear an ally's shield pop (PlaySoundAtPosition; acc_shield_break 2d->3d, dist 200/1500/2000) + wav re-baked mono +10% louder - THIS comment bump forces the bank regen (game CLOSED) -
// audio pass 9 (2026-07-22 fix): headshot ding REVERTED to original wav (user: old one was better); gun-fire wavs fixed - alternator re-cut from the loud shot (old AudioTrimmer trim was near-silent, max -47dB) + cj_fire/tripletake_fire normalized to a punchy level - THIS comment bump forces the bank regen (game CLOSED) -
// audio pass 10 (2026-07-22): gun shooting sounds replaced from the user's proper ZIP (compressed(1).zip) - alternator_fire/cj_fire/tripletake_fire overwritten with full 48k sounds (the earlier AudioTrimmer web-trims were the root problem) - THIS comment bump forces the bank regen (game CLOSED) -
// audio pass 11 (2026-07-22 FIX on-release bug): the ZIP clips had ~0.24-0.37s of LEADING SILENCE before the shot, so the weapon fire sound played nothing on trigger-DOWN (on the CYBERJACK only the stock loopFireEndSound decay was heard on release). Re-cut cj_fire/alternator_fire as short single-shots from the onset + tripletake_fire with its lead-in dropped - THIS comment bump forces the bank regen (game CLOSED) -
// audio pass 12 (2026-07-26 reload-foley fix): Streetsweeper/XM4 reload foley aliases were named with the wav's variant number baked in (shell_in1..4, knob_rotate1..3, regrip1/2) but the xanim "2D Sound" customnotes play the UNsuffixed name -> alias lookup missed -> silent reloads since 07-10. Renamed to same-name round-robin rows (the fire-sound pattern) + added the 6 missing s1_mdl reload foley aliases - THIS comment bump forces the bank regen (game CLOSED) -
// audio pass 13 (2026-08-03 one-song-at-a-time redesign): 10 song rows in acc_audio.csv flipped NONLOOPING -> LOOPING (theme / 7 jukebox songs / paradise 115 + calm) + new NONLOOPING twin acc_paradise_calm_once (win fanfare) + 3 acc_round_sounds.csv rows (round stingers + gameover) flipped looping - every song now rides PlayLoopSound (the only stoppable primitive; see _acc_music.gsc header) - THIS comment bump forces the bank regen (game CLOSED) -
// this comment edit FORCES a sound-bank rebuild after the CachedBanks corruption incident: a bank
// regen ran while BO3 was open holding the .sabs locks -> poisoned incremental cache -> every
// later build re-emitted corrupt banks -> hard crash mid-DB-load, varying points, no error.
// Fix = delete CachedBanks + zone/snd + *.sz outputs AND bump this zone comment, game CLOSED.
// See memory sound-bank-rebuild-zone-trigger): cyan-tinted clone of coolyer's BO1
// numbers FX (repo share/raw/fx/_custom/acc, regen tools/tint_numbers_efx.js; needs the
// numbers pack MATERIAL gfx_fxt_misc_nixnumbers_bo1 installed) + an HB21-library Giant
// teleporter zap. Played by acc_utility::derez_burst (Glitch blink + Phantom warps).
fx,_custom/acc/fx_acc_derez_blink
fx,_custom/acc/fx_acc_derez_blink_phantom   // NEON-YELLOW variant - matches the Phantom's accPhantomAura colour (boss colour language: cyan=Glitch, yellow=Phantom, red=Scientist docs/44)
fx,_custom/acc/fx_acc_derez_blink_red       // RED burst - The Scientist (Pentagon Thief homage, docs/44 workstream B)
fx,_custom/acc/fx_acc_scientist_trail       // RED numbers aura - continuous BO1 tech_trail recipe on a linked tag_origin
