fx,dlc0/factory/fx_teleporter_elec_strike_sparks_os   // extra sparks layer on PHANTOM warps only - the real boss hits harder
fx,dlc0/factory/fx_teleporter_beam_factory            // idle pad BEAM for the Lab<->Exchange teleporter (_acc_teleporter.gsc; HB21 lib, verified on disk)
fx,zombie/fx_aat_fireworks_burst_zmb                  // LEVEL-UP celebration burst (stock AAT "Fireworks" pop; _acc_leveling.gsc acc_levelup_fx, docs/45). Stock, verified installed.
fx,zombie/fx_aat_fireworks_zmb                        // LV10 "Fully Augmented" capstone: the bigger full fireworks (_acc_leveling.gsc acc_levelup_max_fx, docs/45). Stock.
