// whole "make him hostile" trick - engine targeting is team-based; _acc_civil_protector.gsc header).
// NAMING IS LOAD-BEARING: spawner classname actor_spawner_<X> resolves to aitype archetype_<X> -
// the clone's first name "acc_zod_robot_boss" (no archetype_ prefix) made the linker/engine derive
// a nonexistent aitype from the .map spawner ("'spawner_acc_zod_robot_boss' is not a valid aitype")
