// (projSpeed 3500, direct-hit dmg, no falloff/penetration), fireTime 0.1728 base /
// 0.13824 PaP, clip 9/15, reserve 117/180. Bolt visual = 1.25x-size acc CLONES of the
// Blast-O-Matic's glowing DOA geotrail (share/raw/fx/acc/acc_ttk_geotrail_{blue,red}.efx,
// derived by the prep script - sizeGraph scalars x1.25; the owens originals stay untouched)
// + its impact splash; all pack transitively via the weapon refs (round-2/4 visibility passes).
// A trigger pull = 3 bolts / 3 rounds: 1 native center bolt + 2 script side bolts + the <3
// fire gate in scripts/zm/zm_abandoned_cyber_city/_acc_tripletake.gsc. is_energy_weapon ->
// Plasma Generator +10%. Fire sounds acc_ttk_energy_fire_* (the shipped wpn_bo4_paladin_*
// refs exist nowhere = silent-gun trap; alias rows in sound/aliases/acc_apex_weapons.csv).
weapon,apex_tripletake_zm
